---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Why The New Manager Hub exists and who it's for.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">About The New Manager Hub</h1>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <strong>The New Manager Hub</strong> exists because becoming a manager for the first time is one of the biggest career transitions you'll make — and most people get zero preparation for it.
      </p>
      <p>
        One day you're an individual contributor, crushing it at your job. The next day you're responsible for other people's careers, performance, and happiness. Nobody hands you a manual.
      </p>
      <p>
        We've been there. And we built this site to be the resource we wished we'd had: <strong>curated book recommendations, honest course reviews, practical tools, and real-world advice</strong> — all in one place, with no fluff.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every recommendation on this site is something we've personally used or thoroughly researched. We don't recommend things just because they have an affiliate program. If something isn't worth your time, we'll tell you.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">Our philosophy</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Practical over theoretical.</strong> We focus on what actually works in real teams, not academic frameworks.</li>
        <li><strong>Honest recommendations.</strong> If a popular book is overrated, we'll say so. If a free tool beats a paid one, we'll tell you.</li>
        <li><strong>No guru nonsense.</strong> Management isn't mystical. It's a skill you can learn — and we're here to help you learn it faster.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-serif);">How we make money</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses affiliate links. When you buy a book, sign up for a course, or try a tool through our links, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. This keeps the site running and free for everyone.
      </p>
      <p>
        Read our full <a href="/disclosure" class="text-brand-600 underline hover:text-brand-700">affiliate disclosure</a> for details.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
